# **6-Month Roadmap to Become an AI Engineer**  
*(From Python Beginner to AI Engineer with Daily Tasks & Projects)*  

This roadmap is **highly structured**, **project-based**, and **focused on practical skills**.  
Each month builds on the previous one, with **daily exercises**, **projects**, and **key milestones**.  

---

## **📌 Month 1: Python & Data Science Fundamentals**  
**Goal:** Learn Python, NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib, and basic statistics.  

### **Week 1-2: Python Basics**  
✅ **Daily Tasks (1-2 hours/day):**  
- Learn Python syntax (variables, loops, functions, OOP).  
- Solve **10 Python problems/day** on [LeetCode (Easy)](https://leetcode.com/problemset/all/) or [HackerRank](https://www.hackerrank.com/domains/tutorials/10-days-of-python).  
- Build small scripts (calculator, to-do list, password generator).  

📌 **Week 1 Project:**  
- Build a **text-based game** (e.g., Hangman, Tic-Tac-Toe).  

### **Week 3-4: Data Science Basics (NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib)**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Learn **NumPy** (arrays, operations, broadcasting).  
- Learn **Pandas** (DataFrames, filtering, grouping).  
- Practice **Matplotlib/Seaborn** (plots, histograms, heatmaps).  
- Do **1 Kaggle dataset analysis/day** (e.g., Titanic, Iris).  

📌 **Week 3-4 Project:**  
- **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)** on a real dataset (e.g., [Netflix Movies](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/shivamb/netflix-shows)).  

---

## **📌 Month 2: Machine Learning (ML) Fundamentals**  
**Goal:** Learn ML algorithms, Scikit-learn, and model evaluation.  

### **Week 5-6: Supervised Learning (Regression, Classification)**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Learn **Linear/Logistic Regression, Decision Trees, SVM, KNN**.  
- Implement models using **Scikit-learn**.  
- Work on **Kaggle ML competitions** (e.g., House Prices, MNIST).  

📌 **Week 5-6 Project:**  
- **Predict house prices** (Regression) or **digit classification** (MNIST).  

### **Week 7-8: Unsupervised Learning & Model Evaluation**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Learn **Clustering (K-Means, DBSCAN), PCA**.  
- Study **Cross-Validation, Hyperparameter Tuning (GridSearchCV)**.  
- Improve Kaggle submissions with **feature engineering**.  

📌 **Week 7-8 Project:**  
- **Customer Segmentation** (K-Means) or **Anomaly Detection**.  

---

## **📌 Month 3: Deep Learning (Neural Networks & TensorFlow/PyTorch)**  
**Goal:** Learn Neural Networks, CNNs, RNNs, and TensorFlow/PyTorch.  

### **Week 9-10: Neural Networks Basics**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Learn **Perceptrons, Backpropagation, Activation Functions**.  
- Implement a **Neural Network from scratch** (NumPy).  
- Train models on **TensorFlow/Keras**.  

📌 **Week 9-10 Project:**  
- **Handwritten Digit Classifier (MNIST)** using TensorFlow.  

### **Week 11-12: CNNs & RNNs**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Learn **Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs)** for images.  
- Learn **Recurrent Neural Networks (RNNs/LSTMs)** for sequences.  
- Work on **Kaggle image/speech datasets**.  

📌 **Week 11-12 Project:**  
- **Cat vs. Dog Classifier (CNN)** or **Stock Price Prediction (LSTM)**.  

---

## **📌 Month 4: Advanced AI (NLP, Transformers, Reinforcement Learning)**  
**Goal:** Learn NLP, Transformers (GPT, BERT), and RL basics.  

### **Week 13-14: Natural Language Processing (NLP)**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Learn **Tokenization, Word Embeddings (Word2Vec, GloVe)**.  
- Train **Text Classification models** (Spam Detection, Sentiment Analysis).  
- Experiment with **Hugging Face Transformers**.  

📌 **Week 13-14 Project:**  
- **Twitter Sentiment Analysis** or **Chatbot (Seq2Seq)**.  

### **Week 15-16: Transformers & Reinforcement Learning (RL)**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Study **BERT, GPT, and Transformer architectures**.  
- Learn **Q-Learning, Deep Q-Networks (DQN)**.  
- Train a **simple RL agent** (CartPole, Atari).  

📌 **Week 15-16 Project:**  
- **Fine-tune BERT for Text Summarization** or **Train an RL Bot**.  

---

## **📌 Month 5: AI Deployment & MLOps**  
**Goal:** Learn to deploy AI models (Flask, FastAPI, Docker, AWS).  

### **Week 17-18: Model Deployment**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Learn **Flask/FastAPI** for API deployment.  
- Dockerize models using **Docker + Kubernetes**.  
- Deploy on **AWS/GCP (Sagemaker, Vertex AI)**.  

📌 **Week 17-18 Project:**  
- **Deploy a Diabetes Predictor API (FastAPI + Docker)**.  

### **Week 19-20: MLOps (CI/CD, Monitoring)**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Learn **MLflow, Kubeflow, TFX**.  
- Set up **GitHub Actions for AutoML pipelines**.  
- Monitor models with **Prometheus + Grafana**.  

📌 **Week 19-20 Project:**  
- **Build an AutoML Pipeline with GitHub Actions**.  

---

## **📌 Month 6: Capstone Project & Job Prep**  
**Goal:** Build a **portfolio project**, prepare for AI interviews.  

### **Week 21-22: Capstone Project**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Choose a **complex AI project** (e.g., **AI Chatbot, Self-Driving Car Simulator, Stock Trading Bot**).  
- Document it on **GitHub (README, Demo Video)**.  

📌 **Example Projects:**  
- **AI-Powered Resume Scanner (NLP + ML)**  
- **Real-Time Object Detection (YOLO + OpenCV)**  

### **Week 23-24: Interview Prep & Job Search**  
✅ **Daily Tasks:**  
- Solve **50+ ML interview questions** (Glassdoor, LeetCode).  
- Practice **system design for AI** (scaling models, latency optimization).  
- Apply for **AI internships/jobs** (LinkedIn, AngelList).  

📌 **Final Goal:**  
- **Land an AI Engineer role** or **Freelance AI projects**.  

---

